			<name>Assault Leader (Ex)</name>
			<description>Once per day, when the rogue misses with an attack on a flanked opponent, she can designate a single ally who is also flanking the target that her attack missed. That ally can make a single melee attack against the opponent as an immediate action.</description>
			<type>ROGUETALENT.SPECIALATTACK.EXTRAORDINARY.ATTACKOPTION.UNCHAINED ROGUE TALENT</type>
