		</special_quality>
			<name>Weapon Familiarity</name>
			<description>Elves are proficient with longbows (including composite longbows), longswords, rapiers, and shortbows (including composite shortbows), and treat any weapon with the word "elven" in its name as a martial weapon.</description>
			<type>RACIALTRAITS.ELF RACIAL TRAIT.ELF RACIAL DEFAULT.SPECIALQUALITY.SPECIAL QUALITY.WEAPON FAMILIARITY.RACIALWEAPONFAMILIARITY</type>
